    "UIName": "Visor C",
    "Id": "vehicledef_VISOR_C",
    "Name": "Visor C",
    "Details": "The C configuration of the Visor Strike Vehicle transports battle armor on long missions. It mounts two Clan Medium Pulse Lasers and a TAG in the turret, so it does not rely on ammunition, and its cargo container stores supplies and mission equipment next to the Battle Armor Compartment. It is one of the few configurations that Society logistics personnel are allowed to use.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     20\n<b>Left</b>         110     20\n<b>Right</b>       110     20\n<b>Rear</b>        110     20\n<b>Turret</b>      110     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      595    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00>Can Resupply/Repair</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 4 Battle Armor Squads.</color>",
    "Icon": "BurroTruck"
  },
